s used to take a full afternoon. Now they take 10 minutes — our whole team is much happier.”\nDr. Michelle Haghpanah\nOwner, Pediatric Dentistry of San Jose\n“Choosing Lassie has allowed me to transform my operations and embrace a new level of precision in my practice.”\nDr. Mina Levi\nOwner, California Dental Innovations\n“After a year of use, it has significantly accelerated our revenue cycle. Lassie has been wonderful for our practice.”\nDr. Jason Sala\nOwner, Sala Family Dentistry\n“LOVE LOVE LOVE Lassie!!! It changed the insurance game for me”\nDr. Esther Pedersen\nOwner, Love to Smile\nFrom signup to\n0 AR in 3 steps\n\nLassie integrates with your PMS, so your to-do list shrinks while your bank balance grows.\n\nMost practices are fully onboarded within 2 weeks.\n\n1\nConnect your PMS\n\nLassie syncs with Dentrix, Open Dental, Eaglesoft, and more in minutes.\n\n2\nLassie does the work\nPosts EOBs to each patient ledger\nMakes correct adjustments and ledgers notes\nReconciles payments against bank account\nFlags AR and issues for review\n3\nYour team gets time back\n\nHours that used to go to insurance work go back to patients, growth, and going home on time.\n\nGive your team their time back.\n\nJoin 1,000+ dentists using Lassie to handle insurance work. Book a 30-minute demo and see it for yourself.\n\nGet started\nGet started\n\n© 2026 Go Lassie, Inc. All rights reserved.\nMade in San Francisco, CA.\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms of Service"}
